Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 17:41:20 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] cps2w: vsavjw catalogue CRCs for the 14z-110 freeze (the #99
 d2-window fix)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The merged romset rebuilt: program members vm3j.* and the PRG-extension
members vsw.41/42 carry the reaction_hook d2-window fix (VampireSaved
14z-110, GitHub #99 — maintainer-ruled 2026-08-26). jtframe resolves
members by CRC32 alone, so a stale entry means no .rom at all; regenerated
by tools/gen_vsavjw_xml.py from the built vsavjw.zip and verified by its
--check mode (tests/test_mister_mra_map.sh in the main repo).
